WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.151 --> 00:00:01.690
(zombie moans)

00:00:01.690 --> 00:00:03.130
- Oh my god.

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:04.133
This is weird.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.580
Why do they have zombies in a hospital.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.413
What's up, guys?

00:00:08.413 --> 00:00:09.246
Dr. Mike here.

00:00:09.246 --> 00:00:10.610
For those of you who don't know,

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.980
I am a board-certified
family medicine physician,

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.790
but I'm also a gamer part time

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.660
and I've been trying to break
into Minecraft for some time.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.680
Luckily I found a buddy
in Logdotzip, AKA Tyler,

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.513
to help me out.

00:00:22.513 --> 00:00:23.990
He guided me through the process.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.910
I downloaded some hospital maps

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:27.410
and I'm about to give you a review

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.540
of how accurate these hospital maps are,

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:30.600
what I would change.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.280
I'm linking them all down below

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.010
so the creators can get
your downloads as well.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.909
Let's get started. (makes weird noise)

00:00:36.909 --> 00:00:38.300
(zombie growls)

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.347
Modern hospitle.

00:00:40.347 --> 00:00:41.400
Hospitle.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.799
I'm gonna click "I know what I'm doing".

00:00:42.799 --> 00:00:43.632
I'm a physician.

00:00:43.632 --> 00:00:45.120
Okay.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:46.250
I see a sheep.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.860
First of all I want to
come out really far away

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.060
and take a look at this hospital,

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:52.630
because this hospital looks
more like a Miami condo

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:53.690
than it does a hospital.

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:56.460
Is this the garden when
patients go to garden?

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:58.450
Oh my god, I've never played this game.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:00:59.740
I get hit stuff?

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:02.680
Oh, look at these little seagulls.

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:03.993
Wait, what?

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:06.960
What is this?

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.850
They look like little baby eggplants.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:10.233
What are these?

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:12.440
You think they're fishies?

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:15.620
Wait a second, look at
little positive sign!

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:16.770
That's nice.

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:19.460
Let's take a look at the whips
that they put (whip cracks)

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:20.580
in front of the hospital.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.540
This is kind of a whack car.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:25.630
This looks like a Hummer circa 1984.

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:28.730
Wait, why are there pigs
in front of the hospital?

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.490
Some had way too good of a time.

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:33.061
And then there's bones?

00:01:33.061 --> 00:01:33.894
Ooh.

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.670
You can pick the stuff up.

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:38.960
Can I get the little piggy?

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:41.280
Come here little piggy,
piggy, piggy, piggy.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:42.473
Piggy, piggy, piggy.

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:46.050
Wait, I'm trying to ride the piggy.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:47.696
Piggy, let me ride you.

00:01:47.696 --> 00:01:49.030
(gasps) No, don't hit the piggy.

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:50.190
That's a seagull.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:52.460
Do seagulls attack in this game?

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.170
I will say whoever created this,

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:56.300
their gardening in on point.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.910
Oh look, it's a person.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:01:59.310
Or is that a security guard?

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:03.781
It's definitely a security
guard 'cause my man's got a bow.

00:02:03.781 --> 00:02:05.710
Aye, bow, put that bow down, bro.

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:07.710
All right, sorry, I'm creating
havoc in the hospital.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:08.543
Let's go.

00:02:08.543 --> 00:02:12.270
What is going on here?

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:13.840
This is not a hospital.

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:14.853
What is that?

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:19.793
Why is this thingy like this?

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:21.940
Hi.

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.870
And these spiders just
look concerning to me.

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:26.330
There's animals in here.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.030
Is this a veterinary hospital?

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:29.333
Bro is this just,

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.140
if someone just designed a hospital

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:33.990
on the exterior that looks really good,

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.030
I'll give you props.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:36.756
But I expect more.

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:37.589
(sheep baas)

00:02:37.589 --> 00:02:39.040
I just heard a sheep baa.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.860
Failure of the game number one.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.030
You got to have an elevator in a hospital.

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:46.180
That were all the HIPAA
violations take place.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.910
There's just freaking spiders everywhere.

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:51.147
How are you ever gonna get
better when there's spiders?

00:02:51.147 --> 00:02:53.210
Yo, this thing is riding the spider.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.293
It doesn't even care.

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:56.843
This is one unhappy patient.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.410
Why is it green?

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.451
Why are you green, buddy?

00:03:00.451 --> 00:03:01.530
Okay, I'm going to the top floor.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.083
We're going to the penthouse.

00:03:05.404 --> 00:03:07.000
Oh my god,

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:11.010
this person made the
hospital go above the clouds.

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:12.945
Oh, look at these little
ventilators, okay.

00:03:12.945 --> 00:03:16.360
The first accurate part of this hospital.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:18.410
Little AC vent units.

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:19.490
What I would do,

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:22.130
I would confuse people and just say baa.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:23.190
Now you don't know what it is.

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:24.780
It just looks like a pause logo.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:27.340
We have to take off all signage

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:28.700
to not confuse people

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:30.670
so they don't think this is a hospital.

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:32.830
'Cause there's no
hospitaling going on here.

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:36.760
I'm giving this hospital,
on an exterior level,

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:38.220
I give it a seven.

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:41.640
It looks beautiful but it
doesn't look like a hospital.

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:42.720
It has balconies.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:44.670
You don't have balconies on a hospital.

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:47.030
You don't have pools just hanging out here

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.160
for patients to swim in.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.270
Interior I give it a zero.

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:52.730
You don't even have an elevator or stairs.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.390
How you gonna get the patients
from one floor to another?

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:55.550
You got to think about this.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:56.880
I'm starting to get a feel for this

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.100
and I'm kind of thinking if I built my own

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:02.270
it'd be a good hospital.

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:03.124
Just saying.

00:04:03.124 --> 00:04:04.610
(zombie growls)

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:05.700
Ooh.

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:09.080
This one already is like "come in to me".

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.710
This hospital speaks to me.

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:13.000
I probably wouldn't put
the logos like that,

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.030
here and here.

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:15.863
That's too much.

00:04:15.863 --> 00:04:18.040
Is this for people and
then this is for the birds?

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.130
And they got a helicopter pad!

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:22.300
Ooh, if I was a helicopter I'd land here.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:24.650
(mimics helicopter rotors)

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:26.220
I don't know why I like breaking stuff.

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:27.820
This is a good roof.

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:29.360
This is the proper antennae

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.870
that you need for cellular communication.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.690
That kind of looks like a lazer
so that's a little strange.

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:37.070
These need to be on the
roofs of tall buildings

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:39.170
'cause we're so high in the clouds

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.180
you don't want an airplane being like,

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.610
oh, what is that, oh
my god, (weird noises).

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:49.520
Honestly, outside it's
clean, it's thorough,

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:51.617
but it doesn't have any landscaping.

00:04:51.617 --> 00:04:54.530
You know, the landscaping is
gonna cost you some points.

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:57.050
I'm gonna give this
hospital a straight seven.

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:59.860
Just the fact that it doesn't
have any kind of landscaping

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.190
except these bouncy bushes,

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:02.023
I don't like it.

00:05:02.023 --> 00:05:04.520
What's with the spiders, man?

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.940
This one has a spider too!

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:09.350
I'm telling you hospitals
don't have spiders.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.250
All right, let's go
through the main entrance.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:12.640
There's a seagull.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:14.930
Oh look, there's employees
with bows and arrows.

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:15.763
You come in here and you say

00:05:15.763 --> 00:05:18.767
"Hi, I'm here 'cause I
have a bone that's broken.

00:05:18.767 --> 00:05:19.777
"Can you help me?"

00:05:19.777 --> 00:05:21.847
You go to the waiting
area and they're like

00:05:21.847 --> 00:05:24.370
"Sir, we'll call you when you're ready."

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:27.540
And you're like "Oh my god,
this hospital's so mean."

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:28.373
Whoa.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.320
Oh no.

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:32.153
Oh no!

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:36.650
Dr. Mike fell out of
the world, score four?

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:38.053
Okay, respawn me, I need to do that again.

00:05:38.053 --> 00:05:38.970
That was bad.

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:39.803
Is this,

00:05:39.803 --> 00:05:41.190
this is a double room.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:42.910
My god, is this a sink?

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:44.052
This looks like a jail!

00:05:44.052 --> 00:05:46.211
(gasps) Is this a jail hospital?

00:05:46.211 --> 00:05:49.230
(zombies moaning)
(witch chuckles)

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:51.927
The sound effects in this
game are freaking me out.

00:05:51.927 --> 00:05:53.999
(zombies growling and moaning)

00:05:53.999 --> 00:05:55.470
Whoa.

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:57.200
Whoa, were was that?

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.340
I saw something move.

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.900
Is this 'cause I fell out and
they put me into the hospital?

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:02.470
Okay, I need to get out
of here, I'm freaking out.

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:03.683
I'm freaking out!

00:06:04.904 --> 00:06:05.790
No!

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:08.076
I've managed to curtail my fall.

00:06:08.076 --> 00:06:09.650
(zombie moans)

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:11.080
Oh my god.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.083
This is weird.

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.377
Why do they have zombies in a hospital?

00:06:15.377 --> 00:06:16.820
And there's bats in here?

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.270
They need to fix this place up.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.500
And why are there stairs right here?

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:21.940
Why are there, oh oh,

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.503
wait what is that?

00:06:24.503 --> 00:06:25.890
Is that bacon?

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:27.560
Rotten flesh, ew!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.940
First of all, why are they jails?

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:30.773
This looks like,

00:06:30.773 --> 00:06:32.220
free the patient.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.840
Free the patients!

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:36.080
Now it looks like a hospital.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:38.720
And let's expand these rooms.

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:41.293
See, now you have a connecting room.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:45.030
Now people can hang out
together and it's more sociable.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:47.530
Okay, exterior I said was a seven.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.940
Interior has really disappointed me.

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:51.250
It's not a one.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:55.270
I'm gonna give the
interior a three out of 10.

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:56.470
So in this one

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.600
I'm not gonna take away
their full accreditation,

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.250
I'm just gonna take away their L.

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:02.880
So it's a hospita.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:03.990
And it's raining.

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.570
I don't like that, it's raining.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.479
I'm gonna leave now.

00:07:06.479 --> 00:07:07.840
(zombie growls)

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:11.330
Ooh, this hospital is very, very cute.

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.070
I love the color scheme.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.170
If I was a patient

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:16.600
I would be excited to go to this hospital.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:18.520
There's a lot of support animals.

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:20.300
There's emotional support sheep,

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.330
emotional support bushes.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.860
They didn't even try and make it big.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.917
They were like "This is
a tiny community hospital

00:07:26.917 --> 00:07:28.997
"for small doctors like Dr. Mike

00:07:28.997 --> 00:07:30.590
"to come in a see what's up."

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:32.580
I love the design.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:34.143
And again there's spiders.

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.870
What's with the zombies and the spiders?

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:38.703
This is the reception.

00:07:38.703 --> 00:07:40.297
You come in and again you say

00:07:40.297 --> 00:07:43.457
"Hey, I have something
wrong with me, help me.

00:07:43.457 --> 00:07:44.710
"Help me."

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:46.800
And the person's like "Do
you even have insurance,"

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.853
and I'm like "No, help me.

00:07:49.727 --> 00:07:53.320
"I should live in a country
where we are all covered."

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:54.750
Then I realize I was getting political

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:57.130
in a game like Minecraft so
I decided to take the stairs.

00:07:57.130 --> 00:07:59.970
So I'm assuming these are exam rooms.

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:00.803
Come on.

00:08:00.803 --> 00:08:02.870
They didn't even put patients bed in here?

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.060
What is this bench?

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:05.440
What are you supposed to do in bench

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:07.000
besides look at this beautiful view

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.610
and the emotional support animals?

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:09.910
There's one more floor.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.830
I hope to be pleasantly surprised.

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:15.010
You're not supposed to have
open flames in a hospital, bro.

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:17.860
Don't you know that oxygen
tanks are flammable?

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.210
Put all of these out immediately.

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:22.210
And you want to have curtains up

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:24.810
just in case patients
need a little privacy.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.710
This is ridiculous,
I'm getting frustrated.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:29.320
And the room just has AC
vents and nothing else.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:30.300
I'm disappointed.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:33.930
This hospital gets a four, five,

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.000
I think it's cute,

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.430
on the outside.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:38.758
The inside is a solid one

00:08:38.758 --> 00:08:42.300
because there's some thought
behind the lighting set up

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:44.690
but I'm taking away
it's medical privilege.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:45.560
That's it.

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:48.490
No, that kind of still looks
like it has medical privilege.

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:49.975
We got to do this.

00:08:49.975 --> 00:08:51.480
Baa, baa.

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:55.260
Okay, now it just looks
like someone's weird home.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.457
Next.
(zombie growls)

00:08:57.457 --> 00:08:59.160
Single player.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:01.030
There's something
addicting about Minecraft

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:03.030
where you don't have to
worry about the real world.

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:05.105
Just build some blocks.

00:09:05.105 --> 00:09:05.938
Ooh.

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:10.420
I think this is the psychiatric
hospital that I saw.

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:12.710
Look at the exit, 'cause
you can't walk out.

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:13.543
Baa.

00:09:13.543 --> 00:09:17.190
See I like it because you
can't really escape from here.

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:20.543
There's like, you know, barbed wire.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:25.660
And then I'm not sure
what's going on with here.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.110
This looks rather unfinished, the logo.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:29.930
I like these little lighting designs.

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:31.100
This looks nice.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.050
This needs to be figured out.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:34.860
I will say the roof,

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.800
the roof is good.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.020
This is a good roof.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:40.670
You have lights here for planes,

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:42.660
you have this area where you can,

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.130
what is this, a cooking area?

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:46.590
Sound alarm if escape is suspected.

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:48.810
Oh, this is the watch tower.

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:51.620
This roof is really looking legit.

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.093
I'm liking this roof.

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:55.700
This is a good roof.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:58.470
I would like for it to have
a helicopter landing pad

00:09:58.470 --> 00:10:00.130
in case of a psych emergency.

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.040
I can live without it.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:02.050
Outdoors,

